{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator decision, 2026-11-20: the simple solution is that CI checks op-cert trust using main's rebar.toml, not the rebar.toml in the change under review. A change can then never widen the trust list of the gate that checks it."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795214879343949001,"uuid":"152c83c4-aced-42ee-90eb-38f48ee32f7b"}